    <h2>DQ Biscuit &amp; Gravy — The Most Affordable DQ Breakfast</h2>
  <p>At $3.99, the DQ Biscuit &amp; Gravy is the most affordable sit-down-style breakfast item on the <a href="/categories/breakfast">DQ breakfast menu</a>, narrowly edging out the <a href="/items/breakfast-burrito">Breakfast Burrito</a> at $3.49 in price but delivering more volume and a more satisfying, comfort-food eating experience. Find the full DQ menu on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
  <h2>What Makes DQ Country Gravy Special</h2>
  <p>DQ's country gravy is a white, cream-based gravy seasoned with black pepper and savory herbs. It appears across multiple DQ menu items — the Biscuit &amp; Gravy, the <a href="/items/country-breakfast-platter">Country Breakfast Platter</a>, and as the most popular dipping sauce with the <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">Chicken Strip Basket</a>. The gravy's consistency and flavor is one of the most distinctive elements of DQ's food menu identity.</p>
