<p>The DQ Biscuit &amp; Gravy reflects the Southern U.S. comfort food tradition that defines DQ's breakfast menu at select locations. The country gravy recipe — a white, pepper-seasoned cream sauce — is one of the most distinctive flavors in DQ's food portfolio, appearing across the <a href="/items/country-breakfast-platter">Country Breakfast Platter</a> and as the most popular dipping sauce for the <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">Chicken Strip Basket</a>. Find the full DQ menu on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
